  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\n#11560 modified step 16 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#evaluate-a-javascript:-url to pass an `iframe element referrer policy` equal to `targetSnapshotParams's iframe element referrer policy`, however there is no `targetSnapshotParams` in this algorithm.\n\nI assume we're just missing a `Let targetSnapshotParams be the result of snapshotting target snapshot params given targetNavigable.` step earlier on.\n\ncc: @zcorpan \n",
